---
/**
 * Background terminal — replaces the WebGL canvas.
 * The actual lines are emitted client-side by `src/scripts/bg-terminal.ts`
 * in response to scroll progress. The server-rendered shell here is empty
 * so the initial paint is fast and SEO-clean.
 */
---

<div id="bg-terminal" aria-hidden="true">
  <pre class="bg-terminal-output" id="bg-terminal-output"></pre>
</div>
